      "stepNumber": 1,
      "title": "Compute Divergence",
      "mathExpression": "\\nabla \\cdot \\mathbf{F} = 2x + 2y + 2z",
      "explanation": "Differentiate each quadratic term.",
      "why": "Finding divergence."
